<title>USA: United HealthCare creates business unit.</title>
<headline>United HealthCare creates business unit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>United HealthCare Corp said Wednesday it created a new business unit aimed at meeting the the health care needs of rural Americans.</p>
<p>The company said the new Rural Care Management division will handle its existing rural customer base, which currently numbers 250,000. United HealthCare said the unit will also develop programs to extend health care benefits to people living in remote areas.</p>
<p>United HealthCare provides health care management products and services.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 5/8 Wednesday at 44-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
